1
00:00:00,964 --> 00:00:04,094
(Leonard:)Well, that's it.

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:06,670
(Leonard:)That's the end of Roger Abbott.

3
00:00:09,306 --> 00:00:11,506
(Raj:)And we still don't know
who framed him.

4
00:00:14,277 --> 00:00:15,947
(Leonard:)I still keep thinking

5
00:00:15,946 --> 00:00:18,446
(Leonard:)about how an entire life can
seemingly amount to nothing.

6
00:00:18,448 --> 00:00:21,348
(Howard:)I guess the
sad truth is,

7
00:00:21,351 --> 00:00:24,721
(Howard:)not everyone will
accomplish something great.

8
00:00:24,721 --> 00:00:26,351
(Howard:)Some of us

9
00:00:26,356 --> 00:00:28,386
(Howard:)may just have to find meaning

10
00:00:28,391 --> 00:00:31,891
(Howard:)in the little moments
that make up life.

11
00:00:31,895 --> 00:00:34,965
(Leonard:)That's a nice way
of looking at it.

12
00:00:34,965 --> 00:00:36,895
(Howard:)Yeah for you, not for me.

13
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:38,800
(Howard:)I went to space. I'm covered.

14
00:00:41,538 --> 00:00:43,338
(Leonard:)You know what?

15
00:00:43,340 --> 00:00:46,340
(Leonard:)This bottle was meant
to celebrate an achievement.

16
00:00:46,343 --> 00:00:47,873
(Leonard:)Let's make a pact.

17
00:00:47,878 --> 00:00:50,208
(Leonard:)When one of us gets their
first big breakthrough,

18
00:00:50,213 --> 00:00:52,743
(Leonard:)we'll celebrate by opening
this bottle of champagne

19
00:00:52,749 --> 00:00:54,679
(Leonard:)and toasting
Professor Abbott.

20
00:00:54,684 --> 00:00:55,984
(Howard:)I love that.

21
00:00:55,986 --> 00:00:57,016
(Raj:)Yeah, me, too.

22
00:00:57,020 --> 00:00:58,890
(Leonard:)Then, of course,

